    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d138">

                <pb facs="0201" n="187" xml:id="pg187"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">856d.00/1–2249: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in France</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Caffery</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Paris</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-01-22T14:00:00+01:00">January 22, 1949—2
                            p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>280. Schuman<anchor n="1" xml:id="d138-f1"/> said to me last evening, “I beg of
                    you to tell your government that I am most unhappy about Indonesian situation
                    and apprehensive that your policy may in the long run help only the Communists.
                    I know only too well”, he said, “that the Dutch have been stupid, but facing
                    facts and having in mind our situation in Indochina I hope your people will not
                    be too severe with them.”</p>
                <p>I told Shuman that I would transmit his message but at the same time I took
                    occasion again to emphasize our views on the question.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Caffery</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d138-f1" n="1" xml:id="d138-f1-content">
                <p>French Minister for Foreign Affairs.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
